#
# Header rows (names, distinct bits, values) are covered by XBD.termios.h. Behaviour is tested on a
# private pseudo-terminal (XSI); control modes, parity, break, baud rate, hang-up on close and the
# timed delays cannot be observed or are left unspecified there, and are classified accordingly.

